      "label": "High cost of replacing major appliances",
      "description": "The meme implies that a broken dishwasher is a significant financial burden. This requires background knowledge about the real-world cost of replacing major household appliances, which adds to the comedic exaggeration of the situation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_63ae224f"
