      "description": "The meme uses dark humor and morbid imagery (a woman in a coffin) to exaggerate the frustration of a broken dishwasher, which may be considered mildly harmful due to its morbid imagery, even though it is not inherently toxic or discriminatory.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_63ae224f"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
