      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "household appliance users",
      "description": "The meme targets individuals who own and rely on household appliances, particularly dishwashers, and who experience frustration or emotional distress when these appliances break down. The humor stems from the exaggerated comparison of appliance failure to death, which resonates with anyone who has faced the financial and practical burden of replacing a major appliance.",
